  <name>Bing-r</name>
  <summary>A Modern Desktop IPTV and Media Player for all your Binge</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Bing-r is a modern desktop IPTV and media player/manager application.
      Designed as a high-performance, desktop-native media client focused 
      ultimately on Live TV, Flix (VOD and TV Series), library management, 
      high quality playback, discovery, and community-style metadata/reviews
       == Simple modern Media Player for all your Binge in one place.
    </p>
    <p>
      Note: Bing-r does not provide any playlists or other digital content. 
      Bing-r is purely a media and content management and playing 
      application platform. The channels and pictures in the screenshots are 
      for demonstration purposes only.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>M3U-based content manager — import M3U / M3U8 playlists from local files or remote URLs</li>
      <li>Modern application with fluid user experience</li>
      <li>Channel browsing with category and country filters</li>
      <li>Channel search and filtering</li>
      <li>Automatic Metadata and Feed/stream enrichment with scored selection (format, region, name)</li>
      <li>Hardware-accelerated high quality playback via MPV</li>
      <li>Create and Manage Favorites and visit tracking</li>
      <li>Dark theme with modern Qt Quick UI</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
